  "note": "Triennial election of the Portstewart Urban District Council, polled 21 May 1958. Sixteen nominations were received for twelve seats and two withdrew, leaving fourteen at the poll. The Irish News prints the result with votes. Total poll 1,183; spoiled votes 5; percentage poll 54.8. The paper notes that there was no election in 1952 or 1955."
